{"id":"vod_sn_38184","vodId":"38184","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"仰望天空的少女瞳中映照的世界","name_cn":"仰望天空的少女瞳中映照的世界","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a481f2c4c6b3dd58e3df6f9f3e27d872.jpg"},"summary":"日高梦见（相泽舞 配音）是一个平凡的少女，在她的内心深处隐藏着一个不为人知的的秘密，在广阔无垠的天空之中，梦见有时能够看到不可思议的岛屿漂浮其中，然而，能够看到此番景象的，似乎只有她一人。　　某日，一位名叫穆恩特（小野大辅 配音）的红发少年突然出现在了梦见的面前，原来，这个世界分为“天上界”和“地上界”两个部分，而穆恩特就来自于天上界的魔导国。长久以来，一股奇妙的力量维系着两个世界的平衡，维持着两个世界的运转，如今，这股力量渐渐枯竭，天上界因此而陷入了混乱，照这样发展下去，迟早有一天，灾难会波及地上界，而梦见，就是拯救这一切的唯一人选。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gtJz9jh7021/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AXm1iec2HM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5vWfDY8qsY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cYrTnz55301/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aj6K5ZQSte1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W6shz0j6Xz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dkGV4p41Pp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Aaq7GECJnn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FQJbwPntjX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rFZNVXZfBz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hC646zR74U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqGUUmiKL11/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:01.677Z"}